# Production blob mirrors must never live inside the working tree. The local mirror is a
# sibling of the repos at ~/proj/x-data/<project>/ (see that directory's README), because
# this tree holds PHI / financial documents and is headed for a public remote — gitignored
# is not the same as absent, and `git add -f` or `git clean -xdf` would each be a disaster.
#
# storage/app/private/ is already covered by its own stock `*` ignore. These entries are
# the backstop for someone syncing to the obvious-but-wrong place instead.
/blobs/
/x-data/
/storage/blobs/
